  "Winner B_qm chosen by lowest mean normalized RMSE across regions on the holdout (0.169 vs global ratio 0.259).",
  "From 2022 Terra and Aqua drift off their original overpass times (results/overpass_times.md), so the MODIS reference itself changes; holdout scores for 2019-2021 and 2022+ are reported separately in results/metrics_detail.json.",
